    4. Build full arithmetic bbox sequence from smallest outward until clipped strokes leave grid
    5. Render output -- all strokes in fg, rest GREY
    6. Select 2-3 consecutive strokes that are fully within the grid as input strokes
    7. Render input -- selected strokes in fg on BLACK background, rest BLACK
